apple,banana,cherry
  -> 3 fields: [apple] [banana] [cherry]
a,,c,
  -> 4 fields: [a] [] [c] []
"Smith, John",42,"says ""hi"""
  -> 3 fields: [Smith, John] [42] [says "hi"]
name;city;note
  -> 3 fields: [name] [city] [note]
tab	separated	values
  -> 3 fields: [tab] [separated] [values]

  -> 1 fields: []
x,y,z,w
  -> 4 fields: [x] [y] [z] [w]
with max 2: 2 fields
